{%- comment -%}
  KT Visit — storefront photo.

  Rendered inside the Visit section's right-hand column, above or below the map
  depending on the "Photo position" setting. Rendered at its natural aspect
  ratio (no crop) on purpose: the shopfront is a wide facade and cropping the
  sides would cut off the very windows that make it recognisable from the
  pavement.

  Parameters:
    sec — the kt-visit section.settings object.
{%- endcomment -%}

<figure class="kt-visit__photo">
  <div class="kt-visit__photo-inner">
    {% render 'kt-image',
        image: sec.storefront_image,
        class: 'kt-visit__photo-img',
        alt: sec.storefront_alt,
        width: 900,
        height: 600,
        loading: 'lazy',
        sizes: '(min-width: 750px) 56vw, 92vw' %}
  </div>
  {%- if sec.storefront_caption != blank -%}
    <figcaption class="kt-visit__photo-caption">{{ sec.storefront_caption }}</figcaption>
  {%- endif -%}
</figure>
